=== Dungeon Minibosses ===
==== Within Floors ====
{{Mob Table|show_behavior = yes|
{{Mob Table Row|Lost Adventurer (Young)|behavior = Attacks players with a bow, [[Aspect of the Dragons]] and its ability. Heals itself with Golden Apples up to 4 times when at low {{Stat|hp}}. It gains bonus movement speed when it's above 50% health.}}
{{Mob Table Row|Lost Adventurer (Unstable)|behavior = Attacks players with a bow, [[Aspect of the Dragons]] and its ability. Heals itself with Golden Apples up to 4 times when at low {{Stat|hp}}. Sometimes strikes nearby players with lightning, which deals 10% of the player's max {{Stat|hp}} in {{Stat|tdmg}}.}}
{{Mob Table Row|Lost Adventurer (Holy)|behavior = Attacks players with a bow, [[Aspect of the Dragons]] and its ability. Heals itself with Golden Apples up to 4 times when at low {{Stat|hp}}. Regenerates three times as fast.}}
{{Mob Table Row|Lost Adventurer (Superior)|behavior = Attacks players with a bow, [[Aspect of the Dragons]] and its ability. Heals itself with Golden Apples up to 4 times when at low {{Stat|hp}}. Its Dragon Breath ability deals 50% more damage.}}
{{Mob Table Row|Angry Archaeologist|behavior = Has similar {{Stat|Damage}}, lower {{Stat|Health}} and much higher {{Stat|Defense}} than the {{MobSprite|Lost Adventurer}}. Wears [[Perfect Armor]]. Drinks a potion before engaging players, and heals itself with Healing V potions when at low {{Stat|hp}}.}}
{{Mob Table Row|Redstone Warrior|behavior = Tied to the Redstone Secret in the Redstone Warrior room. It acts much like a {{MobSprite|Lost Adventurer}} with much lower HP.}}
{{Mob Table Row|Shadow Assassin|behavior = Spawns with Invisibility which wears off upon engaging a player. Has the highest melee damage of all minibosses and can teleport behind players to attack them. Does not heal.}}
{{Mob Table Row|King Midas|behavior = Players can encounter him only by blowing up his tomb in the King Midas room. He has extremely high {{Stat|Defense}} which reduces over time as his armor breaks. Attacks players with a golden sword, bow and ability of the {{Item|Midas Staff}}.}}
{{Mob Table Row|Frozen Adventurer|behavior = A {{MobSprite|Lost Adventurer}} which wears [[Frozen Blaze Armor]]. It has lower Defense, but gains thunderstorm and freezing abilities.}}
}}

==== Within Boss Arenas ====
Certain {{MobCategory|miniboss}} mobs spawn in {{MobCategory|Boss}} fights:
{{Mob Table|show_behavior = yes|
{{Mob Table Row|Spirit Bear|behavior = Drops a {{Item|Spirit Bow}} when killed, which can be used to damage {{MobSprite|Thorn}}.}}
{{Mob Table Row|Bigfoot|behavior = Can stomp to deal very heavy damage. The damage depends how close the player is to the mob when the attack is performed and how high the mob jumped.}}
{{Mob Table Row|L.A.S.R.|behavior = Shoots lasers that never miss at players.}}
{{Mob Table Row|Jolly Pink Giant|behavior = Can toss boulders. Damage dealt depends on how close the player is to the center of the impact.}}
{{Mob Table Row|The Diamond Giant|behavior = Can use the Sword of 10,000 Truths to deal heavy damage. The mob can also throw the sword to deal even more damage.}}
{{Mob Table Row|Mutant Giant|behavior = Has two random abilities of the previous four giants.}}
}}
